# A starts a game, and Start pauses it, resumes it and pauses it again. The
# title screen changes every frame, and a stopped program leaves the console
# cursor blinking every 30 frames, so an expect-same over exactly 30 frames
# passes only on a paused game.
run 30
pad 0 connect
run 5
pad 0 press a
run 2
pad 0 release a
run 20
pad 0 press start
run 2
pad 0 release start
run 5
mark
run 30
expect-same
pad 0 press start
run 2
pad 0 release start
run 5
expect-changed
pad 0 press start
run 2
pad 0 release start
run 5
mark
run 30
expect-same
